  assign ev_cause_items = 'The scholarship seats.~One seat in four is given free to students who apply, paid for by the tickets that are sold.|The mentoring circles.~Twenty seat groups run all year in Lahore, free to join, with no application fee.|The workbooks.~Every delegate leaves with printed material, which is the thing most people still have a year later.' | split: '|'
